## Goal
Perform principal component analysis (PCA) on the gene count matrix to visualize sample relationships and identify the dominant sources of variation across the RNA-seq samples. Samples will be colored by experimental condition (untreated vs. treated) to examine whether the two conditions separate along the first two principal components.

