| results/pca_biplot.pdf | figure | Scatter plot of PC1 vs PC2 with samples colored by condition; each point labeled with sample ID; variance explained percentages on axes |
| results/pca_screeplot.pdf | figure | Cumulative variance explained by first 4 principal components; shows that PC1 and PC2 capture the majority of variance in the data |

## Execution
Runs: batch

Expected wall time: <5 minutes. PCA on ~18K genes × 6 samples is lightweight.
Expected output size: <10 MB (TSV tables + PDF plots combined).
